    <string name="tc_ui_direct_audio_hint">Plays sound straight through Android AAudio via an ALSA plugin in the guest (libasound_module_pcm_tinyaudio.so). Fixes dropouts and crackling in emulators such as PPSSPP and Dolphin. Wine, SDL and ALSA apps use it automatically; PulseAudio is only started for the virtual mic. Applies on next launch.</string>
